              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "OLE! This is a wonderful guacamole that could be used as a side dish to any Mexican feast (like we did!). I love the colors and the fact that it's FULL of vegetables, and even my 10 year old ate it happily. 10 stars!! Thanks for sharing your recipe!"
