            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rich Amlin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought the proportions all worked well. However, we like our guac spicier, so we added more garlic, 2/3 cup of our favorite salsa, and chipolte hot sauce to taste.",
            "datePublished": "2017-02-08T20:12:21.133Z"
          },
          {
