            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Shannon Adler"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great guacamole! I did not like guacamole until I discovered chunky guacamole! This one is excellent, &amp; I even used frozen avocado chunks after discovering that my fresh were not good. Still fantastic &amp; even easier to make.",
