              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jan Stolzenfeld Rey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just made for the first time today.... And, my daughter who will NEVER touch guacamole dip of any kind , tried this... Could NOT stop eating it, and took the left over home with her!! My husband said, \" it was the best he has ever had and wants me to make it again this week\"! I too have to admit the favors were wonderful, I used 4 cloves of garlic and squeezed the juice of 2 limes,... This is a must try!!!!",
            "datePublished": "2015-07-11T23:46:35.763Z"
