              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Becca18"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this recipe!! I didn't put black beans (forgot to buy) or cilantro (allergic). Still delicious. Also added dribble of olive oil &amp; apple cider vinegar, and used lemon instead of lime. Soooo good! I will double recipe for parties.",
